{"ID":"20240206115001-8vafucy","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206115001-8vafucy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115001-8vafucy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115014-idylr6p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115008-1zgmfxb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115014-idylr6p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:167,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:167\u0026#125;","title":"枸骨叶","type":"doc","updated":"20240902090716"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206115014-idylr6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115014-idylr6p","updated":"20240206115017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t长江中下游各地均产。\n【性状】\t本品呈类长方形或矩圆状长方形，偶有长卵圆形，长38cm，宽1.54cm。先端具3 枚较大的硬刺齿，顶端1枚常反曲，基部平截或宽楔形，两侧有时各具刺齿1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3枚，边缘稍反卷；长卵圆形叶常无刺齿。上表面黄绿色或绿褐色，有光泽，下表面灰黄色或灰绿色。叶脉羽状，叶柄较短。革质，硬而厚。无臭，味微苦。\n【性味】\t苦，凉。\n【功效】\t补肝肾，养气血，祛风湿。用于肺痨咳嗽、劳伤失血、腰膝痿弱、风湿痹痛、跌打损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206115008-1zgmfxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115008-1zgmfxb","updated":"20240206115008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206115008-74zaluv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715105648-g8u5ae0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715105648-g8u5ae0","updated":"20240715105648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 651px;","style":"width: 641px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枸骨 (12)"},{"Type